t time your game connects.</p></div></details></div></div><footer class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-border pt-4"><details class="group min-w-0 flex-1"><summary class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-text-primary cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>Change secret</summary><div class="mt-3 max-w-md"><form action="javascript:throw new Error('A React form was unexpectedly submitted. If you called form.submit() manually, consider using form.requestSubmit() instead. If you\\'re trying to use event.stopPropagation() in a submit event handler, consider also calling event.preventDefault().')" class="grid gap-1.5"><label for="id-5" class="text-sm font-medium">New secret</label><div class="flex gap-2"><input id="id-5" minlength="12" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required="" class="h-10 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-xl border border-border bg-page px-3 font-mono text-sm outline-none transition-colors focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/25 aria-invalid:border-danger" name="secret"><button type="submit" class="inline-flex h-10 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border px-3.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/5 disabled:opacity-60">Save secret</button></div></form></div></details><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-danger/10 hover:text-danger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2 size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg>Delete campaign</button><dialog aria-labelledby="id-6" class="overflow-visible border border-border bg-card p-0 text-text-primary shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50 m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg rounded-2xl"></dialog></footer></article></div></div></div><p role="status" class="sr-only"></p></div></div>"`;

exports[`golden C1: markup the campaigns and the pages a campaign: waiting for its roster: waiting for its roster 1`] = `"<div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[70rem] px-4 pt-6 pb-8 md:px-8 md:pt-8 md:pb-10"><div class="@container/index flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-5"><header class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><h1 id="your-campaigns" tabindex="-1" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight outline-none">Your campaigns</h1><p class="mt-1 max-w-[46ch] text-text-secondary">Set up each campaign you run as Gamemaster, then share its invite link with your players.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border px-4 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info size-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg>Connect Foundry</button><dialog aria-labelledby="id-1" class="overflow-visible border border-border bg-card p-0 text-text-primary shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50 m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg rounded-2xl"></dialog><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary px-4 text-sm font-medium text-on-primary transition-colors hover:bg-primary-hover"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>New campaign</button><dialog aria-labelledby="id-2" class="overflow-visible border border-border bg-card p-0 text-text-primary shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50 m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg rounded-2xl"></dialog></div></header><div class="grid min-w-0 gap-4 @min-[900px]/index:grid-cols-[340px_minmax(0,1fr)] @min-[900px]/index:items-start"><div class="-m-1 min-w-0 flex-col gap-2 p-1 @min-[900px]/index:sticky @min-[900px]/index:top-4 @min-[900px]/index:max-h-[calc(100dvh-2rem)] @min-[900px]/index:overflow-y-auto flex"><h2 id="campaigns-rest" class="sr-only">Campaigns</h2><ul aria-labelledby="campaigns-rest" class="grid gap-2"><li><button type="button" data-campaign="wild" class="grid min-h-11 w-full grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] gap-x-2.5 gap-y-1 rounded-[14px] border bg-card p-3 text-left transition-colors border-border hover:border-primary/40"><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block truncate text-[15px] font-semibold">The Wild Beyond the Witchlight</span><span class="block truncate text-[13px] text-text-secondary">mists.forge-vtt.com</span></span><span><span data-state="offline" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap border-border"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-text-secondary"></span>Offline</span></span><span class="col-span-full flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5"><span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">No characters yet</span></span></button></li></ul></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-col gap-4 hidden @min-[900px]/index:flex"><article aria-labelledby="campaign-wild" class="grid min-w-0 gap-5 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6"><header class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><h2 id="campaign-wild" tabindex="-1" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight break-words outline-none">The Wild Beyond the Witchlight</h2><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary wrap-anywhere">mists.forge-vtt.com</p></div><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 flex-col items-end gap-0.5"><span data-state="offline" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap border-border"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-2 rounded-full bg-text-secondary"></span>Offline</span></span></header><div class="grid min-w-0 gap-5 @min-[900px]/index:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] @min-[900px]/index:items-start"><div class="grid min-w-0 gap-5"><section class="grid gap-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-medium">Characters</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">The campaign’s characters appear here once Foundry sends them. Reloading the game in Foundry sends them at once.</p></section></div><div class="grid min-w-0 gap-5"><section class="grid gap-1.5"><h3 class="text-sm font-medium">Invite link</h3><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-border bg-page py-1 pr-1 pl-3"><code class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-mono text-xs text-text-primary truncate">https://stone.example/join/code-wild</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy invite link" title="Copy" class="shrink-0 rounded-md text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-text-primary inline-flex min-h-9 items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 text-xs font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></span><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Share it with your players. They sign in and choose their character.</p><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>Reset link</button><dialog aria-labelledby="id-3" class="overflow-visible border border-border bg-card p-0 text-text-primary shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50 m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg rounded-2xl"></dialog></div></section><section class="grid gap-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-dices size-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="12" height="12" x="2" y="10" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="m17.92 14 3.5-3.5a2.24 2.24 0 0 0 0-3l-5-4.92a2.24 2.24 0 0 0-3 0L10 6"></path><path d="M6 18h.01"></path><path d="M10 14h.01"></path><path d="M15 6h.01"></path><path d="M18 9h.01"></path></svg>Players' rolls</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">They stay here. To have them made in your game with the same dice, tick Players roll in the app on the campaign’s Player actions tab in Sending Stone’s settings in Foundry.</p></section><section class="grid gap-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left-right size-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3 4 7l4 4"></path><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="m16 21 4-4-4-4"></path><path d="M20 17H4"></path></svg>Items and coins</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Players can’t move items and coins from here. To let them, tick Players move items and coins on the campaign’s Player actions tab in Sending Stone’s settings in Foundry.</p></section><section class="grid gap-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cooking-pot size-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12h20"></path><path d="M20 12v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8"></path><path d="m4 8 16-4"></path><path d="m8.86 6.78-.45-1.81a2 2 0 0 1 1.45-2.43l1.94-.48a2 2 0 0 1 2.43 1.46l.45 1.8"></path></svg>Cookbook dishes</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Off. To take dishes, tick Dishes from the Magical Recipe Book on the campaign’s Player actions tab in Sending Stone’s settings in Foundry.</p></section><section class="grid gap-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars size-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>Players' effects</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Off. To let them, tick Allow Players to disable &amp; remove their own active effects on the campaign’s Player actions tab in Sending Stone’s settings in Foundry.</p></section><section class="grid gap-1"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-paw-print size-4 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="4" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="16" r="2"></circle><path d="M9 10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v3.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-6.84 1.045Q6.52 17.48 4.46 16.84A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 10Z"></path></svg>Wild Shape</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Off. To let them, tick Allow Players to use Wild Shape from the app on the campaign’s Player actions tab in Sending Stone’s settings in Foundry.</p></section><details class="min-w-0"><summary class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-text-primary -ml-2.5 cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-settings-2 size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 17H5"></path><path d="M19 7h-9"></path><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"></circle></svg>Foundry settings</summary><div class="mt-3 grid min-w-0 gap-4 text-sm"><p class="text-text-secondary">Foundry hasn't sent its settings yet. They arrive the next time your game connects.</p></div></details></div></div><footer class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-border pt-4"><details class="group min-w-0 flex-1"><summary class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-text-primary cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-key-round size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z"></path><circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg>Change secret</summary><div class="mt-3 max-w-md"><form action="javascript:throw new Error('A React form was unexpectedly submitted. If you called form.submit() manually, consider using form.requestSubmit() instead. If you\\'re trying to use event.stopPropagation() in a submit event handler, consider also calling event.preventDefault().')" class="grid gap-1.5"><label for="id-4" class="text-sm font-medium">New secret</label><div class="flex gap-2"><input id="id-4" minlength="12" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" required="" class="h-10 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-xl border border-border bg-page px-3 font-mono text-sm outline-none transition-colors focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/25 aria-invalid:border-danger" name="secret"><button type="submit" class="inline-flex h-10 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border px-3.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-primary/5 disabled:opacity-60">Save secret</button></div></form></div></details><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-danger/10 hover:text-danger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trash lucide-trash-2 size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 11v6"></path><path d="M14 11v6"></path><path d="M19 6v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path></svg>Delete campaign</button><dialog aria-labelledby="id-5" class="overflow-visible border border-border bg-card p-0 text-text-primary shadow-xl backdrop:bg-black/50 m-auto w-[calc(100%-2rem)] max-w-lg rounded-2xl"></dialog></footer></article></div></div></div><p role="status" class="sr-only"></p></div></div>"`;

